SOURCE AND TERMS OF REUSE

The text of the laws in this repository is data published by the Department of Justice of the Government of the Hong Kong
Special Administrative Region (the "Government") as bulk files on DATA.GOV.HK:

    Hong Kong e-Legislation (HKeL), past versions of legislation (English)
    https://data.gov.hk/en-data/dataset/hk-doj-hkel-legislation-past
    files: https://resource.data.one.gov.hk/doj/data/hkel_p_leg_cap_1_cap_200_en.zip
           https://resource.data.one.gov.hk/doj/data/hkel_p_leg_cap_201_cap_400_en.zip
           https://resource.data.one.gov.hk/doj/data/hkel_p_leg_cap_401_cap_600_en.zip
           https://resource.data.one.gov.hk/doj/data/hkel_p_leg_cap_601_cap_end_en.zip

