WHAT IS NOT SETTLED

The terms allow reproduction and distribution free of charge, including for commercial purposes, if the source is
identified and the Government's ownership is acknowledged, which this file and the README do. They also require the user to
indemnify the Government against infringement claims, a condition that Lexifina has not reviewed with a lawyer, and the
terms may be revised without notice. The Data are provided as is; the version text is for information, and the
authoritative text of Hong Kong law is the one published by the Government in the Gazette and on elegislation.gov.hk. The
website elegislation.gov.hk has its own terms, which this repository does not rely on: nothing was fetched from it.

Because this is unclear, **this repository is private and must not be made public** until the reuse terms are cleared.

Everything else in this repository that is not the Data (the build scripts, the commit messages, the tables and the
documentation) is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode), to the extent possible under law; this does not extend to
the Data, which remains the Government's.
